                                            *                  controls appropriately for a given situation. See code       D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\usb_device.c
                                            *                  below.                                                       D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\usb_device.c
