                                           			 * Control Read:                                                              D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\usb_device.c
                                           			 * <SETUP[0]><IN[1]><IN[0]>...<OUT[1]> | <SETUP[0]>                           D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\usb_device.c
