                                                * Use a state machine instead.                                              D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\CDC Device Driver\usb_function_cdc.c
                                                */                                                                          D:\Projects\EggBot1-GH\EBB_firmware\Microchip\USB\CDC Device Driver\usb_function_cdc.c
